  "steps": [
    "Blend all the above ingredients until smooth. Use the water in which the dates were soaked. No need to add extra water.",
    "Take 2 tsps of the caramel we prepared (can add more if you prefer your coffee sweeter) and store the rest of the caramel in fridge.",
    "Add 1-1.5tbsp of instant coffee (I am using Nescafe gold, you can alter qty of coffee based on preference)",
    "Using a frother, whip the coffee and date caramel until it doubles. Add 2 tsps of water to froth well.",
    "Then add lots of ice and pour 150ml of chilled double toned milk. Mix it well and its ready."
  ],
